WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,820 --> 00:00:03,820
Do what he says and remove everyone, Brother Kai Yan.

2
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:08,520
Xiaoguang no

3
00:00:10,210 --> 00:00:22,840
He even has that ability

4
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:25,340
Don't move. No one is allowed to attack again.

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:30,640
We were the ones who broke in first, and it was Xiaoguang who made the first move.

6
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:31,640
Withdraw as he said

7
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:33,640
I will not take the initiative to harm humans

8
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:35,640
But I won’t let go of those who actively attack me.
